  "configuration_id": "config_049",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_024 (0.725 accuracy) is the top performer using scvi_n200 RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoders. config_049 uses scvi_n200 RNA (same as config_024) with resnet50 image encoder (similar to config_007) and avgpool aggregation (cost ~4.5 GPU hours). This tests whether switching image encoders and aggregation type while retaining scvi_n200 RNA could yield comparable performance at lower cost. It balances exploration of image encoder alternatives with exploitation of the high-performing RNA encoder."
}

